#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/mavinit.rst:5
#: eca9b08b6cf04eb68cb010a5a6a2b57b
msgid "Startup Scripts"
msgstr "启动脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/mavinit.rst:7
#: 604df645f7bb403fb2dc6ac20e438199
msgid ""
"MAVProxy is capable of executing a script (of MAVProxy commands) on startup."
" This can save the effort of (re)setting up the MAVProxy environment for "
"each flight."
msgstr "MAVProxy 能够在启动时执行一个脚本（包含 MAVProxy 命令）。这可以节省每次飞行前重新配置 MAVProxy 环境的精力。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/mavinit.rst:11
#: 59711d8c33634afeae20c525d2d7efc9
msgid ""
"A script (:file:`mavinit.scr`) should be placed in an aircraft directory "
"(ie. :file:`./Aircraftname/mavinit.scr`) containing the commands. Any normal"
" MAVProxy commands can be placed in here. Note that the --aircraft option "
"must be used in the MAVProxy to begin its execution, in order for MAVProxy "
"to find the script in the appropriate aircraft directory."
msgstr ""
"脚本文件（:file:`mavinit.scr`）应放置在飞机目录中（即 "
":file:`./Aircraftname/mavinit.scr`），其中包含相应的命令。任何正常的 MAVProxy "
"命令都可以放置在此文件中。请注意，MAVProxy 必须使用 --aircraft 选项启动，才能在相应的飞机目录中找到该脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/mavinit.rst:17
#: 8909d0a939c84bd98e17cce998a51aa5
msgid ""
"This script is run at startup and doesn't wait for a vehicle to connect. "
"This script cannot be used to automate configuration of the vehicle or "
"simulation. It will only to configure the MAVProxy options/settings such as "
"additional modules loaded, aliases, etc."
msgstr ""
"该脚本在启动时运行，不会等待飞行器连接。该脚本不能用于自动配置飞行器或仿真，仅用于配置 MAVProxy 选项和设置，例如加载额外的模块、设置别名等。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/mavinit.rst:21
#: 868307ee56544690b6c4ef1d9b7c46a5
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the :file:`.mavinit.scr` can be placed in the user's home "
"directory (ie. :file:`/home/username` in Linux or "
":file:`C:\\\\Users\\\\username\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\MAVProxy` in Windows) "
"and will be loaded with MAVProxy regardless of the --aircraft option."
msgstr ""
"此外，:file:`.mavinit.scr` 也可放置在用户的主目录中（Linux 下为 :file:`/home/username`，Windows"
" 下为 :file:`C:\\\\Users\\\\username\\\\AppData\\\\Local\\\\MAVProxy`），无论是否使用 "
"--aircraft 选项，MAVProxy 都会加载该文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/mavinit.rst:26
#: 36dd7639295c4d24b024fc4d0bbcc2f3
msgid ""
"An example script can be found `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy/blob/master/windows/mavinit.scr>`_."
msgstr ""
"示例脚本可在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy/blob/master/windows/mavinit.scr>`_ "
"找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/mavinit.rst:28
#: 8fd57ce44d0a434f9624ec3c9b955dd5
msgid ""
"In this particular script, aliases are used as shortcuts to common commands."
msgstr "在该示例脚本中，别名被用作常用命令的快捷方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/mavinit.rst:31
#: bd79e10fc5ce4fb1b52e2876daafc37a
msgid ""
"For example the following alias definitions in :file:`mavinit.scr` will "
"allow the user to graph the current battery level by typing ``gbatt`` "
"instead of ``graph SYS_STATUS.current_battery``."
msgstr ""
"例如，在 :file:`mavinit.scr` 中定义以下别名后，用户只需输入 ``gbatt`` 即可绘制当前电池电量图表，而无需输入 "
"``graph SYS_STATUS.current_battery``。"
